00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:22,920
which obviously helps new users get started and helps existing users get the maximum value out of the powerful features that the guys there develop.

121
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,000
Thanks.

122
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:32,000
And I wrote all that old documentation, so thanks for sorting it all out, Andre.

