00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:50,000
So our documentation pages used to be really quite texty, and it didn't have much contextual way of finding at all.

125
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:54,000
And it was a classic case of information overload, and it wasn't obvious where to go next.

