00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:20,000
Our mission is to enable the world to secure the web.

141
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:23,000
And to do that, the world doesn't just need great software.

142
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:26,000
It needs information and learning about web security.

143
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:32,000
One way we deliver that is through our Web Security Academy, and Dave is going to tell us more about that.

144
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,000
Thank you.

