00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:38,000
Hi.

146
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:48,000
So there's quite a demand for web security testers, but it's quite difficult to get into the field.

147
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:56,000
Learning about web security by trying to hack into real-life websites isn't easy and sometimes not very legal.

148
00:13:56,000 --> 00:14:06,000
So we decided to create the Web Security Academy, which teaches people practical web security skills using realistic, hackable web security.

149
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:16,000
We also have a certification that people can use to show their hacking prowess to potential employers.

150
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:20,000
Thanks, David.

151
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:30,000
This education platform is completely free, and millions of people have used it to learn about web security and practice their skills.

152
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:35,000
What's also free is our daily news service called the Daily Swig, appropriately.

