00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:53,000
So you might remember the WannaCry ransomware attack in 2017, which shut down services within the NHS and other organizations worldwide.

155
00:14:53,000 --> 00:15:02,000
Earlier this month was the fifth anniversary of the incident, and we interviewed British researcher Marcus Hutchins, who foiled the attack.

156
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:10,000
He spoke to us for an exclusive feature looking back on what he did to stop the ransomware from spreading and how the threat landscape has changed since.

157
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:16,000
Thanks, Jess.

