00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:46,000
And we create online videos to support the documentation.

162
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:52,000
We support everyone equally, whichever product they're using, and whether they're happy or sad.

163
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:59,000
For people starting out with Burp Suite Enterprise, we go on calls to demo features and understand their challenges.

